# University of Montana (UM)

> Official website of the University of Montana in Missoula, Montana. This file provides a curated index of the primary public resources for students, faculty, staff, researchers, alumni, and visitors.

Base URL: https://www.umt.edu

## Admissions

- [Admissions](https://www.umt.edu/admissions/): Undergraduate admissions, application requirements, campus visits, and enrollment information.
- [Admission and Aid Overview](https://www.umt.edu/admissions-and-financial-aid/): Admissions overview, graduate admissions, and financial aid.
- [Apply Online](https://www.umt.edu/academics/apply/default.php): Online application portal.

## Academics

- [Academics](https://www.umt.edu/academics/): Academic programs, majors, minors, certificates, and colleges.
- [Course Catalog](https://catalog.umt.edu/): Academic catalog, courses, degree requirements, and policies.
- [Online Programs](https://www.umt.edu/online/): Online degree and certificate programs.

## Colleges & Schools

- [Colleges, Schools and Departments](https://www.umt.edu/academics/): Directory of colleges, schools, and academic departments.

